WEBVTT

00:02.830 --> 00:05.250
Yogiri Takatou's ability...

00:05.250 --> 00:07.790
I'm testing what he can

00:05.250 --> 00:09.540
<b>Sage.</b>

00:05.250 --> 00:09.540
<b>Immortal vampire who possesses</b>

00:05.250 --> 00:09.540
<b>an astounding restoration ability.</b>

00:07.790 --> 00:10.540
and what he can't do, Euphemia.

00:10.540 --> 00:11.710
Lain-sama?

00:11.710 --> 00:16.040
What I want to know most
is if he can kill me, however.

00:16.040 --> 00:17.960
<b>Former bodyguard of Yuuki Tachibana.</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:17.960
<b>Now a follower of Lain the Sage</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:17.960
<b>via bloodsucking.</b>

01:48.080 --> 01:50.500
<b>"The Fact That You're Watching This Video..."</b>

01:55.130 --> 01:57.380
Why is the city full of zombies?!

01:57.380 --> 01:59.170
Their movements look slow,

01:59.170 --> 02:02.330
so I think it's possible to escape
if we move cautiously.

02:02.330 --> 02:04.000
Should we be helping them, though?

02:04.000 --> 02:07.540
It's extremely unlikely that we
can save the city in this situation.

02:07.540 --> 02:10.170
It's better not to be concerned with them.

02:10.170 --> 02:12.790
You should get out of here immediately.

02:13.170 --> 02:14.380
Masayuki!

02:14.380 --> 02:16.670
Why the hell did you come here?!

02:16.670 --> 02:20.500
The management of this city
was left entirely to me by Lain-sama!

02:20.500 --> 02:23.460
<b>Follower of Lain the Sage.</b>

02:20.500 --> 02:23.460
<b>Commands the Immortal Corps of the Undead Unit.</b>

02:20.500 --> 02:23.460
<b>Pursuing Yogiri under the orders of Lain.</b>

02:20.750 --> 02:23.130
Don't get so angry, Ryouta.

02:23.500 --> 02:25.380
The Sage candidate era is under Lain.

02:25.380 --> 02:27.460
We're comrades who survived

02:25.540 --> 02:29.130
<b>Attendant of Lain the Sage.</b>

02:25.540 --> 02:29.130
<b>Mayor who runs the city of Hanabusa.</b>

02:27.460 --> 02:29.170
the same battles, right?

02:29.380 --> 02:32.540
You already died and
became an undead, right?

02:32.830 --> 02:36.830
In any case, round up the undead
and then get the hell outta here!

02:36.830 --> 02:39.250
I'm doing this under Lain's orders!

02:39.250 --> 02:40.500
Lain-sama?!

02:40.500 --> 02:43.500
Just hand over the key to this city.

02:45.080 --> 02:47.420
What in the world are you trying to do?!

02:47.580 --> 02:49.880
It's nothing important...

02:50.130 --> 02:52.920
Zombie time's over!

02:54.790 --> 02:56.210
Th-they've stopped!

02:57.500 --> 02:58.460
Check...

02:58.460 --> 03:01.210
Can all you people of Hanabusa hear me?

03:01.210 --> 03:02.750
I'm Masayuki.

03:02.750 --> 03:06.130
I'm a follower of Lain the Sage,
and commander of the Immortal Corps!

03:06.420 --> 03:08.380
I'm searching for a man
named Yogiri Takatou

03:08.380 --> 03:11.580
and a woman named Tomochika Dannoura.

03:11.580 --> 03:15.420
Bring them to the central plaza
within one hour!

03:15.420 --> 03:16.830
Dead or alive, doesn't matter to me!

03:16.830 --> 03:20.290
If you don't bring 'em, the zombies
are gonna start moving again!

03:20.880 --> 03:22.830
Running away is pointless, got that?

03:22.830 --> 03:25.580
The barriers around the city
have been locked.

03:25.580 --> 03:28.420
That leaves you two choices here:

03:28.420 --> 03:32.040
Either get Takatou and his friend to me,
or become zombies!

03:35.040 --> 03:36.290
Hey, Masayuki!

03:36.540 --> 03:39.330
You didn't say anything
about hurting the people!

03:39.330 --> 03:40.500
You idiot!

03:40.670 --> 03:44.710
Who would actually look
if I just asked them to?

03:47.250 --> 03:51.710
Does he have any idea how much I struggled
to get Hanabusa to this point?!

03:52.080 --> 03:53.420
They're over here!

03:53.420 --> 03:55.460
Catch 'em!

03:55.460 --> 03:57.250
They may be more dangerous
than the zombies.

03:57.250 --> 03:59.580
We have no choice but to run
so we won't be found.

03:59.580 --> 04:02.670
But right now we can't even use the train.

04:02.670 --> 04:05.630
I mean, why are we being pursued?

04:07.170 --> 04:10.290
Well, we did kill a Sage.

04:10.290 --> 04:13.580
I guess thoughtlessly killing others
has its drawbacks.

04:14.420 --> 04:15.880
Found 'em!

04:16.330 --> 04:17.380
We're taking 'em in, dead or not!

04:17.380 --> 04:19.130
We can bring them even if they're dead.

04:19.130 --> 04:20.960
Well that didn't take long.

04:20.960 --> 04:22.580
Come near us and I'll kill you.

04:22.580 --> 04:24.250
There's no time! Hurry!

04:24.250 --> 04:25.540
I'll take 'em out!

04:30.460 --> 04:33.750
This is the first time I've seen such
a gross way of carrying out a promise!

04:33.750 --> 04:35.960
They're coming closer
with the intention of killing us,

04:35.960 --> 04:39.080
but it's weird that they think
they themselves won't be killed.

04:40.130 --> 04:41.330
Or maybe...

04:41.330 --> 04:45.580
Are they instigating because they think
I can't kill a normal person?

04:45.750 --> 04:50.500
In that case, I'm a little pissed
at that Masayuki guy from before now.

04:50.790 --> 04:54.710
Can we negotiate with him directly
if we go to the plaza?

05:03.580 --> 05:07.580
This is the most fantasy-like view
I've seen in this world so far.

05:08.830 --> 05:10.830
Are you Masayuki?

05:10.830 --> 05:12.920
You're looking for us, right?

05:12.920 --> 05:14.000
Huh?

05:14.000 --> 05:17.630
You guys are Yogiri Takatou
and Tomochika Dannoura?

05:17.830 --> 05:18.960
That's right.

05:18.960 --> 05:21.630
You came here to present yourselves?

05:21.630 --> 05:23.750
You guys are boring as hell, ugh!

05:23.750 --> 05:27.420
Are you trying to sacrifice yourselves
for the townspeople?

05:27.420 --> 05:28.750
You're out of your mind.

05:28.750 --> 05:32.130
Wait, wait, wait.
Let's be a bit more fair about this!

05:32.130 --> 05:33.630
Then whaddaya want?

05:33.630 --> 05:37.330
If I kill you the game's over!

05:37.330 --> 05:40.500
We want to get on the train
and go to the royal capital.

05:40.500 --> 05:44.380
Would you get rid of the city barrier
so we can use the station?

05:44.580 --> 05:45.540
What?

05:45.540 --> 05:47.040
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

05:47.040 --> 05:49.000
Are you an idiot? Is that it?

05:49.000 --> 05:53.130
You know good and well you aren't in
any position to to be asking for favors!

05:53.130 --> 05:54.250
This is true.

05:54.250 --> 05:56.920
I guess we need something to offer up.

05:57.130 --> 06:00.670
Here's the deal, I'll let you live
even though you're a bastard.

06:02.830 --> 06:04.250
You're out of your mind!

06:04.250 --> 06:05.710
You wanna die right now?!

06:05.710 --> 06:06.710
Huh?!

06:06.710 --> 06:08.420
Go finish 'em off!

06:08.420 --> 06:10.830
My Immortal Corps are an army of the dead!

06:10.830 --> 06:14.420
There's no way you can kill
the already deceased undead!

06:16.170 --> 06:17.080
Die.

06:22.380 --> 06:23.210
What?

06:24.880 --> 06:26.500
What's this?

06:26.500 --> 06:28.380
My Immortal Corps just...

06:28.380 --> 06:30.170
You've gotta be freakin' kidding me...

06:30.170 --> 06:33.750
I'm the feudal lord who governs
this entire area, Ryouta Takahashi.

06:33.750 --> 06:36.670
I have absolutely nothing to do
with this incident!

06:36.670 --> 06:39.000
How did the undead die?!

06:39.000 --> 06:41.540
I don't get that part either, but...

06:41.540 --> 06:43.960
Though you say they're dead,

06:43.960 --> 06:46.210
since they're moving
doesn't that mean they're alive?

06:46.500 --> 06:49.670
You were ignoring that the whole time
and NOW you wanna answer?!

06:49.670 --> 06:51.040
But that's absurd!

06:51.040 --> 06:53.670
How do you kill something that's dead?!

06:53.670 --> 06:56.420
I'm the one who gets
to decide what's dead.

06:56.420 --> 06:57.130
Huh?

06:57.330 --> 07:00.420
If they're moving then they're alive,
and they stop when they die.

07:00.420 --> 07:03.080
It doesn't matter
what you guys think about it.

07:03.080 --> 07:04.080
Damn it!

07:04.080 --> 07:08.000
Lain! Did you know about this crap?!

07:09.250 --> 07:12.210
All of your allies are dead.
What are you gonna do?

07:13.170 --> 07:15.130
You got an Instant Death ability?

07:15.130 --> 07:17.960
No way that's it!

07:20.130 --> 07:21.670
Huh? What's going on with him?

07:21.670 --> 07:22.920
Is he transforming?!

07:22.920 --> 07:24.540
A werewolf... uh, wait...

07:24.540 --> 07:25.790
A bat man?!

07:25.790 --> 07:26.880
Die.

07:28.210 --> 07:30.330
At least let him transform first!

07:30.330 --> 07:34.130
Why should I have to wait
for the most eager guy?

07:34.130 --> 07:36.790
Uh, it's just like, something you do!

07:36.960 --> 07:39.290
But weren't we going to negotiate?

07:39.290 --> 07:41.040
What are we gonna do about the barrier?

07:41.040 --> 07:42.790
That's not a problem.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.830
Right, Ryouta Takahashi-san?

07:44.830 --> 07:46.500
Y-yes?!

07:46.500 --> 07:48.750
I beg you, please don't kill me!

07:48.750 --> 07:51.080
I don't plan to do anything to you two,

07:51.080 --> 07:53.880
and I don't want any more damage
done to the city!

07:53.880 --> 07:57.380
We're only doing this
to protect ourselves.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.710
Please listen, and don't get angry.

07:59.710 --> 08:04.500
It seems that Lain the Sage
ordered Masayuki to kill you two.

08:04.500 --> 08:07.880
What? Wasn't that Sage's name Sion?

08:08.080 --> 08:10.040
Sion-sama is also a Sage,

08:10.040 --> 08:12.750
but this city and its surroundings
are under Lain-sama's control.

08:12.750 --> 08:15.460
As her subordinate,
I look after this area.

08:15.460 --> 08:16.290
What?

08:16.290 --> 08:19.540
We were called here by Sion
and told to become Sages,

08:19.540 --> 08:24.290
but this time a different Sage
named Lain wants us killed?

08:24.290 --> 08:26.500
I haven't heard about that situation,

08:26.500 --> 08:29.920
but interfering with Sage candidates
is not something I normally do.

08:29.920 --> 08:30.920
Boy!

08:31.420 --> 08:32.630
Yes, I'm aware.

08:32.630 --> 08:34.000
Huh? Of what?

08:34.000 --> 08:35.710
Quite broadly speaking,

08:35.710 --> 08:39.710
that type of spritiual manipulation
will be directed at this area.

08:39.710 --> 08:43.500
Of course, we're guarding against attacks
aimed at you, though...

08:43.500 --> 08:44.670
An intent to kill...

08:44.670 --> 08:47.630
It's coming from all directions
and heading towards this plaza.

08:51.960 --> 08:54.170
Huh?! It's not a zombie this time!

08:54.170 --> 08:55.830
It's the living people of the city?!

08:55.830 --> 08:57.080
Oh no...

08:57.080 --> 08:58.250
I know!

08:59.580 --> 09:03.130
If they're using spirit magic,
then the city barriers will keep you safe!

09:05.130 --> 09:06.830
What?! It's not responding?!

09:07.040 --> 09:08.040
It can't be?!

09:08.040 --> 09:09.330
What's going on?

09:09.330 --> 09:10.420
Don't tell me...

09:10.420 --> 09:13.540
Lain-sama is directly manipulating
the barrier?

09:13.830 --> 09:17.670
Master, this method
is extremely dangerous...

09:17.830 --> 09:23.580
Yuuki Tachibana had his hostility traced
even from this distance and was killed.

09:23.580 --> 09:28.710
Euphemia, how much of a threat
do you surmise Yogiri Takatou is?

09:28.710 --> 09:32.330
He may be above a Sage,
a Swordmaster, or mythical beings.

09:32.330 --> 09:36.420
I think we shouldn't get involved
any further with Yogiri Takatou.

09:36.420 --> 09:38.080
So you're saying to run?

09:38.080 --> 09:39.500
That can't be done.

09:39.500 --> 09:40.380
But...

09:40.710 --> 09:45.380
After knowing my abilities,
she's seriously concerned about my safety.

09:45.670 --> 09:50.000
In other words, she thinks Yogiri Takatou
is that formidable of an opponent.

09:54.540 --> 09:57.540
Can't you attack the source
of the manipulation or something?

09:57.540 --> 10:00.250
This may be a bit different
from Tachibana's case.

10:00.250 --> 10:02.420
They were linked through his servants.

10:03.290 --> 10:04.080
Die.

10:07.170 --> 10:08.000
Die.

10:12.170 --> 10:12.880
Die.

10:15.830 --> 10:17.790
It's like we're being tested.

10:18.080 --> 10:21.000
We've experienced
something like this before too.

10:21.500 --> 10:25.830
There was a guy that tried lots of things
to see what I could do.

10:25.830 --> 10:27.580
There's no end to this!

10:27.580 --> 10:29.210
What should we do?

10:29.210 --> 10:32.670
If I just want to end it,
I can do it anyway I want.

10:35.630 --> 10:39.380
It's hard for him to see ordinary citizens
dying right in front of his eyes.

10:40.580 --> 10:43.540
Ryouta-san, move a little bit
more this way.

10:43.540 --> 10:44.750
Are you sure?

10:46.580 --> 10:47.960
Now then...

10:48.210 --> 10:52.210
At this rate, if the Darkness is going
to enter the city, now is a good time.

10:53.040 --> 10:55.920
If I can't do it directly,
then it will be done indirectly...

10:55.920 --> 10:57.500
with unintentional carnage.

10:57.500 --> 11:00.880
We can cause an event
that will result in their deaths.

11:03.210 --> 11:04.080
Huh?!

11:21.670 --> 11:23.080
Lain-sama...

11:23.080 --> 11:25.420
What in the world is this?

11:25.420 --> 11:28.420
Even if this body is burned to a crisp,

11:28.420 --> 11:32.080
I have a restoration ability
that can revive me instantly.

11:32.080 --> 11:35.080
It's no problem if I utilize that.

11:35.540 --> 11:38.500
Go into the sky and increase your number
as you see fit.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.460
Be careful.

11:48.460 --> 11:50.670
The hostility suddenly got stronger.

11:50.670 --> 11:53.330
It's like... the air is dry.

11:55.130 --> 11:57.080
Uh, what's that?!

11:58.250 --> 12:00.630
An Aggressor... the Darkness...

12:00.630 --> 12:03.290
Is this the reason why
Lain-sama is close by?!

12:05.630 --> 12:09.540
When that thing passes through,
does everything crumble into sand?!

12:09.920 --> 12:11.630
It's coming this way.

12:11.630 --> 12:13.750
What the hell am I supposed to do?!

12:14.580 --> 12:18.460
The copies have
no memory of Yogiri Takatou,

12:18.460 --> 12:20.420
so there's no way they'd have
any intent to kill.

12:20.420 --> 12:23.670
Therefore, what happens from now on
will simply be a natural disaster.

12:23.670 --> 12:26.250
All of you see the Darkness, yes?

12:26.500 --> 12:30.080
When it exhibits any abnormal behavior,
then rush the city.

12:30.540 --> 12:33.080
What abnormal behavior
are you anticipating?

12:33.080 --> 12:34.250
Let me see...

12:34.250 --> 12:37.420
When the Darkness moves to attack, or...

12:37.670 --> 12:40.880
Otherwise, when the Darkness has died.

12:41.080 --> 12:43.920
Takatou-kun, maybe...

12:43.920 --> 12:46.290
Do you think you can
do something about that too?

12:46.290 --> 12:47.790
Yeah, I think so.

12:47.790 --> 12:49.130
That's what I thought.

12:49.130 --> 12:51.960
No matter how you slice it, if you don't
know what that sort of thing is then-

12:51.960 --> 12:53.040
Wait, you can?!

12:53.040 --> 12:55.000
Are you sure?! Please do something!

12:55.000 --> 12:57.250
If there's anything I can do, tell me!

12:57.420 --> 12:58.920
So please, help us!

12:59.460 --> 13:00.460
Hurry!

13:00.710 --> 13:03.000
I have a bad feeling about this...

13:03.000 --> 13:06.670
But even so, I can't just
leave things as they are.

13:07.500 --> 13:08.380
Die!

13:18.710 --> 13:19.960
Hit the ground!

13:28.210 --> 13:29.460
Wh-what?

13:29.460 --> 13:31.420
Is that the Darkness's attack?

13:31.420 --> 13:32.420
No.

13:32.420 --> 13:34.000
I killed the Darkness.

13:34.460 --> 13:38.330
Apparently, it's somehow blending in with
the Darkness's bloodlust and attacking.

13:38.750 --> 13:43.580
Is it trying to level the whole area
en masse with no particular target?

13:43.580 --> 13:46.460
I think it's been watching what I can do.

13:46.790 --> 13:48.540
Um, Takatou-kun?

13:49.040 --> 13:52.000
I'm fine now, so can you let me go?

13:52.000 --> 13:55.290
Oh, I was wondering what was so soft...

13:55.290 --> 13:59.290
Can you quit with the Hollywood-esque
embrace and do something about this?!

13:59.290 --> 14:02.040
We're not embracing!
This is very much one-sided!

14:02.250 --> 14:04.750
But it's easy for you
to tell me to just do something.

14:05.130 --> 14:07.960
I have no idea what'll come flying at me.

14:08.210 --> 14:09.920
Hm? Uh...

14:10.330 --> 14:13.460
I'm seeing something
that I'm finding hard to believe...

14:13.460 --> 14:14.460
What is it?

14:14.460 --> 14:19.040
A woman wearing a red dress
is coming down from the sky in hordes.

14:19.040 --> 14:22.170
If it's a red dress, that's Lain-sama!

14:22.170 --> 14:24.000
What is she even doing?!

14:24.000 --> 14:26.790
This is Lain's attack, then?

14:26.790 --> 14:28.540
Can you take care of her?

14:28.750 --> 14:30.210
Since she's not aiming for me,

14:30.210 --> 14:32.580
she isn't a target of
the automatic counterattack,

14:32.580 --> 14:36.250
and the Lains coming toward us
are so fast I can't find them, so...

14:36.250 --> 14:38.750
It's a countermeasure against me.

14:38.960 --> 14:41.580
They all look like the same woman, though.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.750
How many Lains are there?

14:43.750 --> 14:45.380
She's most likely splitting.

14:45.380 --> 14:50.710
Lain-sama's super regeneration ability
can even easily produce copies of herself!

14:50.830 --> 14:52.830
In that case, I suppose
I can do something about it.

14:54.000 --> 14:57.630
It'd be simple if she aimed
at me directly, though.

14:57.880 --> 14:59.750
What can you do if you're targeted?!

15:00.330 --> 15:05.250
All citizens, please evacuate
to a shelter immediately.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.630
My class is Mayor.

15:07.630 --> 15:09.830
I can get a bird's-eye view of the city.

15:10.170 --> 15:12.420
I've been watching
the damage for awhile now,

15:12.420 --> 15:14.420
but there's a pattern to the attacks.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.920
It doesn't attack the same place twice

15:16.920 --> 15:19.580
and consecutive attacks
aren't made close to each other.

15:19.580 --> 15:22.000
Even if she's trying
to do something at random,

15:22.000 --> 15:24.920
she's inadvertently
made something consistent.

15:24.920 --> 15:26.880
Then we can narrow down
where the next point will be

15:26.880 --> 15:28.040
to a certain extent, right?

15:28.250 --> 15:29.710
We should wait...

15:29.710 --> 15:31.500
Over here will work!

15:31.500 --> 15:33.130
Okay, I'm heading that way.

15:33.130 --> 15:34.500
Please let me help!

15:34.500 --> 15:36.250
If you're inside the city
I'm in control of,

15:36.250 --> 15:37.960
I can teleport us all together.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.040
Takatou-kun! I'm coming too!

15:40.040 --> 15:43.630
It'd be safer for you to hide,
Dannoura-san.

15:43.790 --> 15:47.380
I'm the one who can see it
so it's more likely we'll succeed, right?

15:47.380 --> 15:48.290
Boy!

15:48.290 --> 15:51.460
I also have a little something
up my sleeve!

16:02.170 --> 16:03.420
The rest is up to you!

16:13.670 --> 16:14.460
It's here!

16:19.040 --> 16:20.000
Die!

16:20.580 --> 16:21.630
Mokomoko-san!

16:21.630 --> 16:22.460
Right!

16:37.630 --> 16:39.630
That was hard to do off the cuff.

16:39.630 --> 16:41.830
Nearly gave myself a heart attack.

16:41.830 --> 16:44.750
I thought it was rather sturdy,

16:44.750 --> 16:47.420
but I had no idea just how sturdy
without testing it out!

16:47.670 --> 16:48.630
What's that?

16:48.630 --> 16:51.130
I got this from the Aggressor
a little while ago.

16:51.540 --> 16:55.580
It's usually worn under clothing,
but with Mokomoko's spirit power,

16:55.580 --> 16:58.710
it can transform into a shelter
or a suit of armor!

16:58.710 --> 17:02.420
The shape can be freely set
and it's also quite sturdy!

17:02.420 --> 17:04.500
It's called a "Furemaru."

17:04.500 --> 17:05.330
Furemaru?

17:05.330 --> 17:07.670
It's short for "Flexible Material."

17:08.000 --> 17:10.630
Are you sure you're from the Heian Period?

17:10.960 --> 17:15.420
But isn't defeating all of the copies
just a drop in the bucket?

17:15.420 --> 17:18.330
I felt like I hit the bull's-eye,
so we may be okay.

17:20.790 --> 17:23.250
How can an immortal vampire die?

17:24.170 --> 17:25.710
What in the world...

17:25.960 --> 17:27.750
My copies have been destroyed.

17:27.750 --> 17:30.420
Since they were all created
using the same template,

17:30.420 --> 17:32.580
they've all been defeated.

17:32.580 --> 17:36.580
We really shouldn't have gone after
Yogiri Takatou!

17:37.130 --> 17:42.130
Next I just have to make copies that
each differ slightly from the settings.

17:43.540 --> 17:46.000
My body... it can't be...

17:46.170 --> 17:48.790
My main body in
another dimension is dead?

17:48.790 --> 17:50.710
By what logic is this happening?

17:50.710 --> 17:53.210
What has he done to me?

17:55.670 --> 17:56.830
Lain-sama!

17:57.710 --> 18:00.040
But this is the point.

18:00.580 --> 18:04.540
This is how I'm supposed
to save that girl.

18:09.170 --> 18:10.830
The attacks have quieted down.

18:10.830 --> 18:13.380
Looks like we did well, somehow.

18:13.380 --> 18:16.960
Let's head to where Ryouta-san is
and secure the transfer.

18:16.960 --> 18:20.920
You're right, we should get away
from this place as quickly as possible.

18:20.920 --> 18:21.830
Yeah!

18:39.080 --> 18:41.290
I'm like a vampire...

18:49.420 --> 18:55.790
You watching this footage
means that my scheme was a success.

18:55.790 --> 18:58.960
I died, and you survived.

18:59.380 --> 19:02.380
First, I'll explain starting with
your true identity.

19:02.750 --> 19:04.290
You are me.

19:05.380 --> 19:08.540
You are a copy made from me,

19:08.540 --> 19:12.330
but you're also a separate person
who did not inherit any of my memories.

19:12.330 --> 19:16.250
That is to avoid the attacks
of Yogiri Takatou.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.330
Yogiri Takatou!

19:20.330 --> 19:22.920
I can't thank you enough.
You really saved us.

19:22.920 --> 19:27.920
Well, even though you're thanking us,
we beat that Sage...

19:27.920 --> 19:29.380
I'm telling you, it's fine.

19:29.380 --> 19:31.500
I have no respect for someone like that.

19:31.500 --> 19:33.880
Thanks so much for everything.

19:33.880 --> 19:35.380
Good bye, be careful out there.

19:39.210 --> 19:42.540
Maybe this is somewhere
a boy should be driving!

19:42.540 --> 19:46.830
But I always crash into the walls
on the curves in racing games.

19:47.210 --> 19:49.710
Right. I'll drive.

19:50.210 --> 19:51.500
I hope I can do this...

19:51.500 --> 19:52.420
Don't worry!

19:52.420 --> 19:55.290
I'll initiate you into the
Dannoura school driving technique,

19:55.290 --> 19:57.540
so just leave it to me!

19:57.790 --> 19:59.920
Can you quit with that cheap act of

19:59.920 --> 20:01.880
attaching the "Dannoura school"
to everything?

20:01.880 --> 20:03.670
Whether it's a tank or a helicopter,

20:03.670 --> 20:05.960
you will be fully versed
in how to drive it!

20:05.960 --> 20:08.130
Don't sell the Dannoura name short!

20:08.130 --> 20:12.250
Just what in the world
is my family doing with that skill?

20:14.210 --> 20:15.670
Off we go!

20:16.880 --> 20:18.960
C'mon, say something!

20:18.960 --> 20:21.580
It feels like I'm the only one
enjoying myself here!

20:22.000 --> 20:23.250
You got this.

20:24.170 --> 20:27.130
Yeah, fine, I'll do my best!

20:28.210 --> 20:30.250
Ryouko, it went that way!

20:30.250 --> 20:31.130
I'll take care of it!

20:32.630 --> 20:38.500
<b>(Samurai)</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:38.500
<b>Specializes in the art</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:38.500
<b>of the blade using a katana.</b>

20:44.750 --> 20:46.130
Nicely done!

20:46.130 --> 20:48.130
A worthy member of the Samurai class!

20:48.130 --> 20:50.420
Let's end here for today.

20:58.710 --> 20:59.790
Who's there?!

21:00.500 --> 21:02.920
<b>(Ninja)</b>

21:00.500 --> 21:02.920
<b>Specializes in covert operations</b>

21:00.500 --> 21:02.920
<b>and combat using ninjutsu.</b>

21:00.960 --> 21:02.960
Oh, hello, Ryouko!

21:03.420 --> 21:05.080
Carol S. Lane.

21:05.080 --> 21:07.420
I'd appreciate it if you'd get permission
before coming in here.

21:07.420 --> 21:08.170
Huh?

21:08.170 --> 21:09.540
My smartphone...

21:09.540 --> 21:11.420
When did I lose that?

21:11.420 --> 21:12.960
I came to give it to you!

21:13.960 --> 21:16.630
Thanks. Where was it?

21:16.630 --> 21:19.830
Actually, I secretly took it!

21:19.830 --> 21:20.630
What?

21:20.630 --> 21:23.380
The battery's gonna die,
so I brought it back!

21:23.380 --> 21:24.830
What are you trying to do?

21:24.830 --> 21:29.790
I wanted to see the Takatou-kun
monitoring tool, but it was impossible.

21:29.790 --> 21:31.170
Who the hell are you?

21:31.170 --> 21:32.790
I'm an American ninja!

21:32.790 --> 21:35.040
That's a class in this world, right?!

21:35.330 --> 21:36.500
Or perhaps...

21:36.500 --> 21:41.330
Since we can't return to our world,
there's no need to keep secrets, right?

21:41.330 --> 21:44.330
If you guys were also
monitoring Takatou-kun,

21:44.330 --> 21:46.750
then don't you have a monitoring tool?

21:46.750 --> 21:51.580
We've prepared a satellite exclusively for
Takatou-kun that was always watching him,

21:51.580 --> 21:53.830
but it's got no use in this world.

21:59.830 --> 22:01.040
No way...

22:01.040 --> 22:05.920
<b>Notice</b>

22:01.040 --> 22:05.920
<b>Alpha Omega</b>

22:01.040 --> 22:05.920
<b>First Door</b>

22:01.040 --> 22:05.920
<b>Open</b>

22:02.460 --> 22:05.250
The first door is opening?!

23:38.040 --> 23:39.290
"Alpha Omega"
